#requires -Version 5.1
<# ScopeSentinel R45 - FULL source-embedded cumulative installer (fresh Windows install or in-place upgrade; config, data and audit history kept).
Contains the entire application, helpers and tests; no previous installer or release is required for its code.
Retains R36 controller operations/readiness/ACL/HOME/launcher identity and restores R36 provider keep_alive/test regressions.
R45: repeating ARTEX/Cairn problems (e.g. AI model not found, quiet Cairn) now raise a plain-language Needs-attention banner and badge; ARTEX control-route stop; color-coded merged engine logs; readiness panel only when blocked; Cairn short hints.
Native ARTEX/Cairn tools, Docker workers and network paths are NOT intercepted or contained. No agent/provider/firewall/network changes.
#>
